   "desc": "Chicago Enterprise AI **Important:** Register on the[ ](https://www.aicamp.ai/event/eventdetails/W2026101209)[Event Website](https://www.aicamp.ai/event/eventdetails/W2026120109) to receive the joining link. (RSVP on Meetup will NOT receive the joining link.) Brought to you by Google Cloud and AI Camp, Agents in Production for Enterprises is a global event series designed for organizations ready to move beyond AI experimentation and into production reality. This series brings together Google Cloud engineers, partner architects, and enterprise practitioners to tackle the real-world challenges of building and deploying agentic AI at scale. At this episode, we team up with Oracle to learn: Building Autonomous Agents: Grounding Gemini on Oracle Databases with MCP. **Tech Talk: Building Autonomous Agents: Grounding Gemini on Oracle Databases with MCP** **Speaker:** Anwar Belayachi (Google) **Abstract:** Custom Natural-Language-to-SQL solutions are notoriously complex to build, difficult to secure, and brittle in production. This fast-paced, live-demo session introduces a game-changing solution: the Oracle AI Database Agent for Gemini and the Remote MCP (Model Context Protocol) Server. We’ll demonstrate how to securely connect Gemini to your Oracle database with zero custom query-translation code. This walkthrough shows how Gemini safely interprets a user's natural language request, builds and executes the appropriate database queries, and returns secure, human-readable results. Learn how Gemini is revolutionizing daily DBA operations, moving teams past simple database maintenance to intelligent automation. **Who Should Attend?** This series is designed for enterprise practitioners who are building or planning to build AI agents: * Developers & Engineers building AI-powered applications * Data Scientists & ML Engineers operationalizing models * Solutions Architects & Tech Leads designing enterprise AI infrastructure * Engineering Leaders & Decision Makers driving AI adoption **Venue:** Virtual, join from anywhere. **More Virtual AI Events:** * Dec 4th: AI Deep Dive with Google Ep 6.[ RSVP](https://www.aicamp.ai/event/eventdetails/W2026120409) * Dec 9th: AI Webinar with Diagrid and AWS. [RSVP](https://www.aicamp.ai/event/eventdetails/W2026120910) * Dec 17th: AI Webinar with NVIDIA. [RSVP](https://www.aicamp.ai/event/eventdetails/W2026121709)",
