   "desc": "Analytics.Club Chicago: Data & AI Community, Connect. Grow. AI can take a lot of content, campaign and reporting work off your plate. In this hands-on hour, learn how to prompt well, pick the right AI tools and automate repetitive tasks. Leave with a ready-to-use prompt library, then meet other marketers in small-group intros. 📍 Where: Join virtually at: [https://4way.im/aimarketersac](https://4way.im/aimarketersac) 🕓 Run of show: \\* 1st Tuesday of every month \\* 1 hour of hands-on learning \\* 1 hour of optional networking (small-group intros, cameras optional) 👤 Who should attend: \\* Marketing, content, social, SEO and brand professionals \\* Marketing managers and team leads \\* Founders and small teams who handle their own marketing \\* Freelancers and agency teams 🧠 What you'll take away: \\* How to write better prompts \\* Which AI tools to use, and when \\* How to automate repetitive tasks and build simple agents \\* A prompt library for content, campaigns, SEO and reporting \\* How to use AI safely: brand voice, privacy and fact-checking 🎓 Keep learning (free certificate) ❓ Have Questions or Suggestions? Reach out to us at: 👉 [https://noworkerleftbehind.org/event_support](https://noworkerleftbehind.org/event_support) 🔖 Hashtags: #AIMarketers #AIForMarketing #PromptingForMarketers #AIToolsForMarketers #MarketingAutomationWithAI #FreeAIWorkshopForMarketers",
